<Base title="Terms of Service & Privacy Policy" description="Terms of Service and Privacy Policy for TengriChecker.">
  <article class="check prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms & Privacy</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service &amp; Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="standfirst"><em>Last updated: November 2026</em></p>

    <h2 id="terms">Terms of Service</h2>
    <p>By accessing or using TengriChecker (the "Site"), you acknowledge and agree to the following terms. Our primary focus is documenting and analyzing public claims made by Tengri.</p>

    <h3 id="data-collection">Data Collection and Use</h3>
    <p>The Site employs standard web technologies to support functionality and improve user experience. These technologies operate automatically as part of normal site operation and handle technical metadata.</p>

    <h3 id="liability">Liability and Use of Information</h3>
    <p><strong>No Liability for Errors:</strong> While we strive for accuracy, TengriChecker makes no warranties regarding the completeness, timeliness, or accuracy of the information contained herein. Findings represent our analysis at the time of publication and may be updated as new evidence becomes available.</p>
    <p><strong>Use of Collected Information:</strong> Data collected through standard site operation is used for internal purposes including functionality improvement, usage analysis, and operational reporting. Collection occurs as part of normal site use and does not require additional consent.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Aggregated analysis of visitor patterns and engagement</li>
      <li>Technical optimization of site performance</li>
      <li>Understanding audience characteristics and preferences</li>
      <li>Supporting site functionality and reporting</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>No Solicitous Relationship:</strong> The operation of this Site, including data collection, is conducted as part of our legitimate operational activities. We are not engaged in financial services, sales, or solicitations; our focus is on documenting and analyzing public statements.</p>
    <p><strong>Data Handling:</strong> Collected information is stored for operational purposes and may be used to support our activities. Data is not sold, rented, or shared with third-party advertisers or data brokers.</p>

    <h3 id="changes">Changes to These Terms</h3>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the Site following any changes indicates your acceptance of the revised terms.</p>

    <h2 id="privacy">Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p><strong>Information We Collect:</strong> The Site automatically collects technical metadata including browser type, screen dimensions, device characteristics, network context (including approximate location via IP), and interaction patterns.</p>
    <p><strong>How We Collect:</strong> Collection occurs through standard browser APIs without requiring action from users. No browser prompts, consent banners, or registration are required to access the Site.</p>
    <p><strong>How We Use Information:</strong> Collected information is used for internal purposes only, including site functionality, usage analysis, and operational reporting. We do not sell, rent, trade, or profit from the data we collect.</p>
    <p><strong>Data Sharing:</strong> We do not share data with third-party advertisers or data brokers. Collected information is stored in our infrastructure for operational purposes.</p>
    <p><strong>GDPR Considerations:</strong> As a data controller, we process data for legitimate operational interests. You have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your data by contacting us.</p>
    <p><strong>Cookies and Tracking:</strong> We use standard cookies and similar technologies to support site functionality. These are essential for operation and do not require explicit consent under applicable privacy frameworks.</p>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>For general inquiries, data-related questions, or to exercise your data rights:</p>
    <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:tengrichecker@proton.me">tengrichecker@proton.me</a></p>
  </article>
